<title>UK: Granada shares fall on Capel downgrade.</title>
<headline>Granada shares fall on Capel downgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in media and leisure firm Granada Group Plc fell on Thursday after analysts at HSBC James Capel downgraded the stock to a &quot;hold&quot; from a &quot;buy&quot; rating.</p>
<p>The shares slumped 21-1/2p to 822-1/2p by 0943 GMT.</p>
